  "releaseNotes": "- Fixed a bug where `PositionIntent` set with `WithPositionIntent` was dropped when the order was wrapped with `TakeProfit`, `StopLoss`, `Bracket`, or `OneCancelsOther`.\n- Updated MessagePack from 3.1.7 to 3.1.12 to address a security advisory.\n- Updated Polly from 8.6.3 to 8.8.0.\n- Updated System.IO.Pipelines, System.Threading.Channels, and System.Net.Http.WinHttpHandler from 9.0.8 to 10.0.13.\n- Updated Portable.System.DateTimeOnly from 9.0.1 to 9.0.2.\n- Updated transitive dependencies: Microsoft.Bcl.AsyncInterfaces from 9.0.8 to 10.0.13 and System.Threading.Tasks.Extensions from 4.5.4 to 4.6.3 (.NET Standard 2.0 and .NET Framework), and Microsoft.Bcl.HashCode from 1.1.1 to 6.0.0 (.NET Framework).",
